{"id":"motion-landing","title":"Motion-Driven — Animated Landing","description":"Movement as the design language — staggered word entrances, a living gradient blob, an infinite marquee, a magnetic button and scroll-triggered counters. For premium landing pages and product demos.","tags":["motion","animation","landing-page"],"type":"code","link":null,"updated":"2026-10-11T18:28:52.838Z","docs":{"file":"design.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Motion-Driven — Animated Landing\ndescription: Movement as the design language — staggered word entrances, a living gradient blob, an infinite marquee, a magnetic button and scroll-triggered counters. For premium landing pages and product demos.\ntags: [motion, animation, landing-page]\norder: 10\n---\n\n# Motion-Driven — Animated Landing\n\nEverything responds: words slide up on load with stagger, a colour blob breathes behind the hero, the CTA magnetically follows the cursor, stats count up on view and a marquee never stops.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Background | `#0c0c11` near-black with a breathing violet→cyan blob |\n| Ink on dark | `#f2f2f5` · secondary `#9b9ba7` |\n| Marquee strip | `#1c1c26` with `✦` separators |\n| CTA | `#c8f542` lime pill, ink text |\n\n## Motion inventory\n\n1. Hero words: clip-mask slide-up, 90ms stagger\n2. Blob: `border-radius` + position keyframes, 12s loop\n3. Magnetic CTA: `pointermove` translate toward cursor, springs back\n4. Stats: cubic ease count-up on IntersectionObserver\n5. Marquee: infinite `translateX` loop\n6. Scroll reveals on every section\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n","body":"\n# Motion-Driven — Animated Landing\n\nEverything responds: words slide up on load with stagger, a colour blob breathes behind the hero, the CTA magnetically follows the cursor, stats count up on view and a marquee never stops.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Background | `#0c0c11` near-black with a breathing violet→cyan blob |\n| Ink on dark | `#f2f2f5` · secondary `#9b9ba7` |\n| Marquee strip | `#1c1c26` with `✦` separators |\n| CTA | `#c8f542` lime pill, ink text |\n\n## Motion inventory\n\n1. Hero words: clip-mask slide-up, 90ms stagger\n2. Blob: `border-radius` + position keyframes, 12s loop\n3. Magnetic CTA: `pointermove` translate toward cursor, springs back\n4. Stats: cubic ease count-up on IntersectionObserver\n5. Marquee: infinite `translateX` loop\n6. Scroll reveals on every section\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n"},"files":[{"path":"index.html","lang":"html","content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>PULSE — Motion Landing\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { font-family: \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, sans-serif; background: #0c0c11; color: #f2f2f5; overflow-x: hidden; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }\n  .wrap { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }\n\n  /* breathing blob */\n  .blob-wrap { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none; overflow: hidden; }\n  .blob { position: absolute; width: 560px; height: 560px; top: -120px; left: 50%; margin-left: -280px; background: conic-gradient(from 90deg, #7c3aed, #06b6d4, #7c3aed); filter: blur(110px); opacity: 0.35; border-radius: 46% 54% 58% 42% / 52% 44% 56% 48%; animation: breathe 12s ease-in-out infinite; }\n  @keyframes breathe {\n    0%, 100% { border-radius: 46% 54% 58% 42% / 52% 44% 56% 48%; transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }\n    33% { border-radius: 58% 42% 44% 56% / 44% 58% 42% 56%; transform: translate(50px, 30px) scale(1.12); }\n    66% { border-radius: 42% 58% 52% 48% / 56% 46% 54% 44%; transform: translate(-40px, 60px) scale(0.94); }\n  }\n\n  nav { position: relative; z-index: 2; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 24px 0; }\n  .logo { font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.18em; font-size: 14px; }\n  .logo b { color: #c8f542; }\n  nav .cta { background: #c8f542; color: #0c0c11; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; border: 0; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 20px; cursor: pointer; }\n\n  header { position: relative; z-index: 2; text-align: center; padding: 110px 0 90px; }\n  .words { font-size: clamp(40px, 8vw, 84px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.02; }\n  .words .w { display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: bottom; }\n  .words .w i { display: inline-block; font-style: normal; transform: translateY(110%); animation: rise 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) forwards; }\n  .words .w:nth-child(2) i { animation-delay: 0.09s; } .words .w:nth-child(3) i { animation-delay: 0.18s; }\n  .words .w:nth-child(4) i { animation-delay: 0.27s; } .words .w:nth-child(5) i { animation-delay: 0.36s; }\n  .words .lime { color: #c8f542; }\n  @keyframes rise { to { transform: none; } }\n  .tagline { color: #9b9ba7; font-size: 17px; margin: 26px auto 36px; max-width: 520px; opacity: 0; animation: fadein 0.8s ease 0.55s forwards; }\n  @keyframes fadein { to { opacity: 1; } }\n  .cta-big { display: inline-block; background: #c8f542; color: #0c0c11; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15px; border: 0; border-radius: 999px; padding: 16px 34px; cursor: pointer; opacity: 0; animation: fadein 0.8s ease 0.7s forwards; transition: transform 0.2s ease; will-change: transform; }\n  .cta-note { display: block; margin-top: 14px; font-size: 12px; color: #9b9ba7; opacity: 0; animation: fadein 0.8s ease 0.85s forwards; }\n\n  .marquee { position: relative; z-index: 2; background: #1c1c26; border-top: 1px solid #26262f; border-bottom: 1px solid #26262f; overflow: hidden; }\n  .marquee div { display: inline-flex; gap: 34px; white-space: nowrap; padding: 13px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9b9ba7; animation: slide 20s linear infinite; }\n  .marquee b { color: #c8f542; }\n  @keyframes slide { to { transform: translateX(-50%); } }\n\n  section { position: relative; z-index: 2; padding: 80px 0; }\n  .rv { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(22px); transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease; }\n  .rv.on { opacity: 1; transform: none; }\n  h2 { font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 40px); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n  .lead { color: #9b9ba7; font-size: 15.5px; max-width: 520px; }\n  .stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 22px; margin-top: 40px; }\n  .stat { border: 1px solid #26262f; border-radius: 18px; padding: 26px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); }\n  .stat .n { font-size: 40px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #c8f542; }\n  .stat .l { color: #9b9ba7; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 4px; }\n  @media (max-width: 700px) { .stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"blob-wrap\">\u003cdiv class=\"blob\">\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\n    \u003cnav>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"logo\">PUL\u003cb>✦\u003c/b>SE\u003c/div>\n      \u003cbutton class=\"cta\">Sign up\u003c/button>\n    \u003c/nav>\n\n    \u003cheader>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"words\">\n        \u003cspan class=\"w\">\u003ci>Design\u003c/i>\u003c/span>\n        \u003cspan class=\"w\">\u003ci>that\u003c/i>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\n        \u003cspan class=\"w\">\u003ci class=\"lime\">moves\u003c/i>\u003c/span>\n        \u003cspan class=\"w\">\u003ci>before\u003c/i>\u003c/span>\n        \u003cspan class=\"w\">\u003ci>it\u003c/i>\u003c/span>\n        \u003cspan class=\"w\">\u003ci class=\"lime\">speaks.\u003c/i>\u003c/span>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cp class=\"tagline\">Pulse is a motion-first toolkit — every element on this page is alive. Hover the button. Scroll the numbers. Feel the blob breathe.\u003c/p>\n      \u003cbutton class=\"cta-big\" id=\"magnet\">Try the magnetic button →\u003c/button>\n      \u003cspan class=\"cta-note\">Move your cursor around it. It likes you.\u003c/span>\n    \u003c/header>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"marquee\">\u003cdiv>\n    \u003cspan>60fps everywhere\u003c/span>\u003cb>✦\u003c/b>\u003cspan>zero dependencies\u003c/span>\u003cb>✦\u003c/b>\u003cspan>spring physics\u003c/span>\u003cb>✦\u003c/b>\u003cspan>scroll hooks\u003c/span>\u003cb>✦\u003c/b>\u003cspan>staggered reveals\u003c/span>\u003cb>✦\u003c/b>\n    \u003cspan>60fps everywhere\u003c/span>\u003cb>✦\u003c/b>\u003cspan>zero dependencies\u003c/span>\u003cb>✦\u003c/b>\u003cspan>spring physics\u003c/span>\u003cb>✦\u003c/b>\u003cspan>scroll hooks\u003c/span>\u003cb>✦\u003c/b>\u003cspan>staggered reveals\u003c/span>\u003cb>✦\u003c/b>\n  \u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\n    \u003csection>\n      \u003ch2 class=\"rv\">Numbers that move too\u003c/h2>\n      \u003cp class=\"lead rv\">Scroll into view and they count themselves up. Small details, big life.\u003c/p>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"stats\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"stat rv\">\u003cdiv class=\"n\" data-n=\"98\">0\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"l\">% smoother than static pages*\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"stat rv\">\u003cdiv class=\"n\" data-n=\"60\">0\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"l\">frames per second, locked\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"stat rv\">\u003cdiv class=\"n\" data-n=\"0\">0\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"l\">JS libraries harmed**\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/section>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    // magnetic CTA — follows the cursor, springs back\n    const m = document.getElementById('magnet');\n    addEventListener('pointermove', e => {\n      const r = m.getBoundingClientRect();\n      const cx = r.left + r.width / 2, cy = r.top + r.height / 2;\n      const dx = e.clientX - cx, dy = e.clientY - cy;\n      const dist = Math.hypot(dx, dy);\n      if (dist \u003c 140) m.style.transform = `translate(${dx * 0.28}px, ${dy * 0.28}px)`;\n      else m.style.transform = '';\n    });\n\n    // count-up stats on view\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver(es => es.forEach(en => {\n      if (!en.isIntersecting || en.target.dataset.done) return;\n      en.target.dataset.done = 1;\n      en.target.closest('.rv')?.classList.add('on');\n      const target = +en.target.dataset.n, t0 = performance.now();\n      (function tick(t) {\n        const p = Math.min((t - t0) / 1400, 1);\n        en.target.textContent = Math.round(target * (1 - Math.pow(1 - p, 3)));\n        if (p \u003c 1) requestAnimationFrame(tick);\n      })(t0);\n    }), { threshold: 0.6 });\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-n]').forEach(el => io.observe(el));\n\n    // section reveals\n    const rio = new IntersectionObserver(es => es.forEach(en => en.isIntersecting && en.target.classList.add('on')), { threshold: 0.2 });\n    document.querySelectorAll('.rv').forEach(el => rio.observe(el));\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}],"preview":{"file":"index.html","html":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\u003cscript>(function(){try{window.localStorage.getItem(\"__probe__\")}catch(e){var s={};var o={getItem:function(k){return k in s?s[k]:null},setItem:function(k,v){s[k]=String(v)},removeItem:function(k){delete s[k]},clear:function(){s={}},key:function(i){return Object.keys(s)[i]||null}};Object.defineProperty(o,\"length\",{get:function(){return Object.keys(s).length},configurable:true});try{Object.defineProperty(window,\"localStorage\",{value:o,configurable:true})}catch(e2){}}})();\u003c/script>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>PULSE — Motion Landing\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { font-family: \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, sans-serif; background: #0c0c11; color: #f2f2f5; overflow-x: hidden; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }\n  .wrap { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }\n\n  /* breathing blob */\n  .blob-wrap { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none; overflow: hidden; }\n  .blob { position: absolute; width: 560px; height: 560px; top: -120px; left: 50%; margin-left: -280px; background: conic-gradient(from 90deg, #7c3aed, #06b6d4, #7c3aed); filter: blur(110px); opacity: 0.35; border-radius: 46% 54% 58% 42% / 52% 44% 56% 48%; animation: breathe 12s ease-in-out infinite; }\n  @keyframes breathe {\n    0%, 100% { border-radius: 46% 54% 58% 42% / 52% 44% 56% 48%; transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }\n    33% { border-radius: 58% 42% 44% 56% / 44% 58% 42% 56%; transform: translate(50px, 30px) scale(1.12); }\n    66% { border-radius: 42% 58% 52% 48% / 56% 46% 54% 44%; transform: translate(-40px, 60px) scale(0.94); }\n  }\n\n  nav { position: relative; z-index: 2; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 24px 0; }\n  .logo { font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.18em; font-size: 14px; }\n  .logo b { color: #c8f542; }\n  nav .cta { background: #c8f542; color: #0c0c11; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; border: 0; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 20px; cursor: pointer; }\n\n  header { position: relative; z-index: 2; text-align: center; padding: 110px 0 90px; }\n  .words { font-size: clamp(40px, 8vw, 84px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.02; }\n  .words .w { display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: bottom; }\n  .words .w i { display: inline-block; font-style: normal; transform: translateY(110%); animation: rise 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) forwards; }\n  .words .w:nth-child(2) i { animation-delay: 0.09s; } .words .w:nth-child(3) i { animation-delay: 0.18s; }\n  .words .w:nth-child(4) i { animation-delay: 0.27s; } .words .w:nth-child(5) i { animation-delay: 0.36s; }\n  .words .lime { color: #c8f542; }\n  @keyframes rise { to { transform: none; } }\n  .tagline { color: #9b9ba7; font-size: 17px; margin: 26px auto 36px; max-width: 520px; opacity: 0; animation: fadein 0.8s ease 0.55s forwards; }\n  @keyframes fadein { to { opacity: 1; } }\n  .cta-big { display: inline-block; background: #c8f542; color: #0c0c11; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15px; border: 0; border-radius: 999px; padding: 16px 34px; cursor: pointer; opacity: 0; animation: fadein 0.8s ease 0.7s forwards; transition: transform 0.2s ease; will-change: transform; }\n  .cta-note { display: block; margin-top: 14px; font-size: 12px; color: #9b9ba7; opacity: 0; animation: fadein 0.8s ease 0.85s forwards; }\n\n  .marquee { position: relative; z-index: 2; background: #1c1c26; border-top: 1px solid #26262f; border-bottom: 1px solid #26262f; overflow: hidden; }\n  .marquee div { display: inline-flex; gap: 34px; white-space: nowrap; padding: 13px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9b9ba7; animation: slide 20s linear infinite; }\n  .marquee b { color: #c8f542; }\n  @keyframes slide { to { transform: translateX(-50%); } }\n\n  section { position: relative; z-index: 2; padding: 80px 0; }\n  .rv { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(22px); transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease; }\n  .rv.on { opacity: 1; transform: none; }\n  h2 { font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 40px); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n  .lead { color: #9b9ba7; font-size: 15.5px; max-width: 520px; }\n  .stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 22px; margin-top: 40px; }\n  .stat { border: 1px solid #26262f; border-radius: 18px; padding: 26px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); }\n  .stat .n { font-size: 40px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #c8f542; }\n  .stat .l { color: #9b9ba7; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 4px; }\n  @media (max-width: 700px) { .stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"blob-wrap\">\u003cdiv class=\"blob\">\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\n    \u003cnav>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"logo\">PUL\u003cb>✦\u003c/b>SE\u003c/div>\n      \u003cbutton class=\"cta\">Sign up\u003c/button>\n    \u003c/nav>\n\n    \u003cheader>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"words\">\n        \u003cspan class=\"w\">\u003ci>Design\u003c/i>\u003c/span>\n        \u003cspan class=\"w\">\u003ci>that\u003c/i>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\n        \u003cspan class=\"w\">\u003ci class=\"lime\">moves\u003c/i>\u003c/span>\n        \u003cspan class=\"w\">\u003ci>before\u003c/i>\u003c/span>\n        \u003cspan class=\"w\">\u003ci>it\u003c/i>\u003c/span>\n        \u003cspan class=\"w\">\u003ci class=\"lime\">speaks.\u003c/i>\u003c/span>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cp class=\"tagline\">Pulse is a motion-first toolkit — every element on this page is alive. Hover the button. Scroll the numbers. Feel the blob breathe.\u003c/p>\n      \u003cbutton class=\"cta-big\" id=\"magnet\">Try the magnetic button →\u003c/button>\n      \u003cspan class=\"cta-note\">Move your cursor around it. It likes you.\u003c/span>\n    \u003c/header>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"marquee\">\u003cdiv>\n    \u003cspan>60fps everywhere\u003c/span>\u003cb>✦\u003c/b>\u003cspan>zero dependencies\u003c/span>\u003cb>✦\u003c/b>\u003cspan>spring physics\u003c/span>\u003cb>✦\u003c/b>\u003cspan>scroll hooks\u003c/span>\u003cb>✦\u003c/b>\u003cspan>staggered reveals\u003c/span>\u003cb>✦\u003c/b>\n    \u003cspan>60fps everywhere\u003c/span>\u003cb>✦\u003c/b>\u003cspan>zero dependencies\u003c/span>\u003cb>✦\u003c/b>\u003cspan>spring physics\u003c/span>\u003cb>✦\u003c/b>\u003cspan>scroll hooks\u003c/span>\u003cb>✦\u003c/b>\u003cspan>staggered reveals\u003c/span>\u003cb>✦\u003c/b>\n  \u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\n    \u003csection>\n      \u003ch2 class=\"rv\">Numbers that move too\u003c/h2>\n      \u003cp class=\"lead rv\">Scroll into view and they count themselves up. Small details, big life.\u003c/p>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"stats\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"stat rv\">\u003cdiv class=\"n\" data-n=\"98\">0\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"l\">% smoother than static pages*\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"stat rv\">\u003cdiv class=\"n\" data-n=\"60\">0\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"l\">frames per second, locked\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"stat rv\">\u003cdiv class=\"n\" data-n=\"0\">0\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"l\">JS libraries harmed**\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/section>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    // magnetic CTA — follows the cursor, springs back\n    const m = document.getElementById('magnet');\n    addEventListener('pointermove', e => {\n      const r = m.getBoundingClientRect();\n      const cx = r.left + r.width / 2, cy = r.top + r.height / 2;\n      const dx = e.clientX - cx, dy = e.clientY - cy;\n      const dist = Math.hypot(dx, dy);\n      if (dist \u003c 140) m.style.transform = `translate(${dx * 0.28}px, ${dy * 0.28}px)`;\n      else m.style.transform = '';\n    });\n\n    // count-up stats on view\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver(es => es.forEach(en => {\n      if (!en.isIntersecting || en.target.dataset.done) return;\n      en.target.dataset.done = 1;\n      en.target.closest('.rv')?.classList.add('on');\n      const target = +en.target.dataset.n, t0 = performance.now();\n      (function tick(t) {\n        const p = Math.min((t - t0) / 1400, 1);\n        en.target.textContent = Math.round(target * (1 - Math.pow(1 - p, 3)));\n        if (p \u003c 1) requestAnimationFrame(tick);\n      })(t0);\n    }), { threshold: 0.6 });\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-n]').forEach(el => io.observe(el));\n\n    // section reveals\n    const rio = new IntersectionObserver(es => es.forEach(en => en.isIntersecting && en.target.classList.add('on')), { threshold: 0.2 });\n    document.querySelectorAll('.rv').forEach(el => rio.observe(el));\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}}